==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|rom|wangar||coal}}, from {{etyl|sa|en}} {{m|sa|अङ्गार|tr=áṅgāra||charcoal, coal}}, from {{etyl|iir-pro|en}} {{m|iir-pro|*Hángāras}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₁óngʷl̥}}. The English term {{m|en|coal}} was itself used as a slang term for money in England in the 18th and 19th century.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈwɒŋɡə/}}
* {{rhymes|ɒŋɡə|lang=en}}

